&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;当連結会計年度（自  2023年４月１日  至  2024年３月31日）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
